{
  "name": "EL Group Entertainment AI Assistant - Master Workflow",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "telegram-webhook",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "node-telegram-webhook",
      "name": "Telegram Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [100, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const body = $input.item.json.body;\nconst callback = body.callback_query;\nconst message = body.message;\n\nlet chatId = 0;\nlet fromId = 0;\nlet text = '';\nlet isCallback = false;\nlet callbackData = '';\n\nif (callback) {\n  isCallback = true;\n  chatId = callback.message.chat.id;\n  fromId = callback.from.id;\n  callbackData = callback.data || '';\n} else if (message) {\n  chatId = message.chat.id;\n  fromId = message.from.id;\n  text = (message.text || '').trim();\n}\n\nconst isStart = text === '/start' || text.toLowerCase() === 'menu' || callbackData === 'menu_start';\n\nreturn {\n  chatId,\n  fromId,\n  text,\n  isCallback,\n  callbackData,\n  isStart\n};"
      },
      "id": "node-parse-telegram",
      "name": "Parse Keyboards & Routing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [300, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "boolean": [
            {
              "value1": "={{ $json.isStart }}",
              "value2": true
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "node-check-start",
      "name": "Is Start or Menu",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [500, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $json.chatId }}",
        "text": "👋 <b>Selamat Datang di EL GROUP AI Assistant!</b>\n\nLayanan resmi informasi & reservasi Spa, Karaoke KTV, dan Club EL Group.\n\nSilakan pilih menu di bawah ini:",
        "replyMarkup": "inlineKeyboard",
        "inlineKeyboard": {
          "rows": [
            {
              "row": {
                "buttons": [
                  { "text": "📍 Daftar Outlet & Lokasi", "callbackData": "btn_outlets" },
                  { "text": "⏰ Jam Operasional", "callbackData": "btn_jamops" }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "row": {
                "buttons": [
                  { "text": "💎 Price List & Paket", "callbackData": "btn_pricelist" },
                  { "text": "🪪 Daftar Member", "callbackData": "btn_member" }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "row": {
                "buttons": [
                  { "text": "📞 Reservasi / Booking", "callbackData": "btn_booking" }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "additionalFields": {
          "parse_mode": "HTML"
        }
      },
      "id": "node-send-start-menu",
      "name": "Send Start Menu Keyboard",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [750, 200],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "telegram-cred",
          "name": "Telegram Bot Account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.3
        }
      },
      "id": "node-openai-model",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [600, 500],
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "openai-cred",
          "name": "OpenAI Account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.text || $json.callbackData }}",
        "hasSystemPrompt": true,
        "systemPrompt": "=Anda adalah EL GROUP AI Customer Service (Spa & Karaoke Jakarta). Sapa pengguna dengan 'kak', ramah, sopan, natural, profesional.\n\nKONTEN OUTLET & JAM OPS:\n- EL CENTRO, EL SPA PANGJAY, EL SEVEN CLUB (Gajah Mada)\n- EL NORTE (PIK)\n- EL FENIX, EL SPA GADING (Kelapa Gading)\n- EL ORCA (GLC)\n- EL CASA (GADSER)\n- EL MEMENTO (JAKSEL)\n\nATURAN ROUTING KONTAK BOOKING:\n- Booking EL NORTE -> Kim Asst Norte (@kimasst / WA: https://wa.me/qr/XQRRH3QXZCZAA1)\n- Booking EL FENIX -> Dori Asst Fenix (@Doriasst / WA: https://wa.me/qr/KSTLRQATOQ2PC1)\n- Booking Umum / Outlet Lain -> Madam Tika (@MadamTika / WA: https://wa.me/qr/O6QEVDUNDJB4G1)\n\nANTI-HALUSINASI: Jangan mengarang harga, promo, WA, Telegram, alamat, room, atau ketersediaan therapist jika tidak ada data.\nJIKA REQUIRING HUMAN ADMIN: Sertakan tag [NEED_ADMIN] di bagian paling akhir respon Anda."
      },
      "id": "node-ai-agent",
      "name": "AI Assistant Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.6,
      "position": [750, 450]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $json.chatId }}",
        "text": "={{ $json.output }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "parse_mode": "HTML"
        }
      },
      "id": "node-send-telegram-reply",
      "name": "Send Reply Telegram",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [1000, 450],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "telegram-cred",
          "name": "Telegram Bot Account"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Telegram Webhook": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Parse Keyboards & Routing",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Parse Keyboards & Routing": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Is Start or Menu",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Is Start or Menu": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Send Start Menu Keyboard",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "AI Assistant Agent",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "OpenAI Chat Model": {
      "ai_languageModel": [
        [
          {
            "node": "AI Assistant Agent",
            "type": "ai_languageModel",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "AI Assistant Agent": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Send Reply Telegram",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  }
}
